  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/02/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/c0b721f0dcca0137caaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/02/2",
    "published": "2026-10-02T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "Although an unexplained phenomenon, there is a place on the outskirts of Mayfield, Nebraska, where the sun does not shine."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/02/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/10b12ec0cdd30137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/02/1",
    "published": "2026-10-02T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"So! You've been fighting again! And in your new suit, too!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/02/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/69cca920cdd20137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/02/0",
    "published": "2026-10-02T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\" And then the creatures yanked him out of the ground, skinned him alive, boiled him, and ate him. The end. Now go to sleep!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/01/4",
