  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/01/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/9d1a9800e9ef0137cf93005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/01/0",
    "published": "2026-10-01T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "Summoned by the gonging, Professor Crutchfeld stepped into the clearing. The little caterpillars had done well this time in their offering."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/503ecb50d8ba0137c959005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/4",
    "published": "2026-09-30T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Uh-oh, Ruby. ... The apartment downstairs is awfully quiet.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/90033170e4780137cd9d005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/3",
    "published": "2026-09-30T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Okay, you've passed the fire test, the riding test, and the combat test but now, paleface, now you must say ‘toy boat' three times real fast!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/705a46f0e6f80137ce50005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/2",
    "published": "2026-09-30T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"On three, Vince. Ready?\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/40fc72e0fa840137d52f005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/1",
    "published": "2026-09-30T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "Paramecium humor"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/40760810e6f80137ce50005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/30/0",
    "published": "2026-09-30T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Oh, yeah? Lewis, you're fired! You apparently forgot this is a cartoon, and I can read every word you think!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/29/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/04585120cdd30137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/29/4",
    "published": "2026-09-29T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"And the last gladiator left alive will win the contest. But first the egg-toss!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/29/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/27c28bd0e92f0137cf47005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/29/3",
    "published": "2026-09-29T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Confession time, Mona I've led you astray.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/29/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/80f255d0dcca0137caaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/29/2",
    "published": "2026-09-29T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "Stupid clerks"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/29/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/277fd020e92e0137cf47005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/29/1",
    "published": "2026-09-29T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"So please welcome our keynote speaker, Professor Melvin Fenwick the man who, back in 1952, first coined the now common phrase: ‘Fools! I'll destroy them all!'\""
  },
