    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/24/4",
    "published": "2026-09-24T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"The fuel light's on, Frank! We're all going to die! Wait, wait. Oh, my mistake that's the intercom light.\""
